536
00:48:23,812 --> 00:48:26,521
Are you out of your mind?
We'll get arrested.

537
00:48:27,729 --> 00:48:29,479
Do you want to be a director someday?

538
00:48:31,271 --> 00:48:32,187
Yes. So?

539
00:48:32,896 --> 00:48:35,229
You still lack one thing.

540
00:48:35,896 --> 00:48:38,312
You need to be convicted of some crimes.

541
00:48:38,979 --> 00:48:40,396
-Out of the way.
-Oh, god! Hey!

542
00:48:40,479 --> 00:48:41,312
Let's go, miss.

543
00:48:41,979 --> 00:48:44,271
This way, miss. Here we go.

544
00:48:45,021 --> 00:48:48,354
-Hey, wait! Are you fucking insane?
-We don't have to pay to film here.

545
00:48:48,437 --> 00:48:50,021
