-It's free.

546
00:48:50,729 --> 00:48:52,646
-Hold on!
-Wow!

547
00:48:52,729 --> 00:48:54,729
-Hey, pal! Give me the camera!
-Let's go.

548
00:48:54,812 --> 00:48:55,771
Help!

549
00:48:55,854 --> 00:48:57,396
-You're nuts!
-What a nice day.

550
00:48:57,479 --> 00:48:59,271
