We'll get arrested!

552
00:49:02,604 --> 00:49:03,854
Hey, man!

553
00:49:06,396 --> 00:49:07,979
Let's film right here.

554
00:49:08,062 --> 00:49:10,229
-You want me to film?
-Yes. Here.

555
00:49:10,729 --> 00:49:12,271
Make sure you film it well.

556
00:49:12,896 --> 00:49:14,104
Now it's rolling.

557
00:49:14,937 --> 00:49:16,854
-Look through it!
-Fine, goddammit!

558
00:49:16,937 --> 00:49:18,271
Okay, here we go.

559
00:49:19,271 --> 00:49:20,271
Ready.

560
00:49:21,521 --> 00:49:22,521
Action.

561
