Why the heck are you filming me?

562
00:49:40,396 --> 00:49:41,354
Come on!

563
00:49:41,437 --> 00:49:43,521
-Film the actress' face!
-Okay, got it.

564
00:49:43,604 --> 00:49:44,437
Got it.

565
00:49:44,937 --> 00:49:46,271
-Hold on.
-Is this the police?

566
00:49:46,854 --> 00:49:50,937
