572
00:50:09,854 --> 00:50:13,896
Hey, you damn cop! Don't stop them now!
It's just getting better!

573
00:50:13,979 --> 00:50:15,187
Stop this!

574
00:50:15,271 --> 00:50:20,104
Look at everyone! See?
They are all in the mood to fuck.

575
00:50:20,187 --> 00:50:21,396
In the mood to fuck?

576
00:50:21,479 --> 00:50:24,312
That's right.
Look at the twinkle in their eyes.

577
00:50:24,396 --> 00:50:25,812
Aren't you Toru Muranishi?

578
00:50:25,896 --> 00:50:28,729
Yes. I am Toru Muranishi.

579
00:50:28,812 --> 00:50:30,271
Goddamn you, Muranishi!

580
00:50:30,354 --> 00:50:31,937
Stop right there, Muranishi!

581
00:50:34,104 --> 00:50:35,104
Underpants!

582
00:50:40,312 --> 00:50:41,437
