585
00:50:51,937 --> 00:50:53,437
My, what a pretty lady.

586
00:50:53,521 --> 00:50:55,979
I wish we had met
under more romantic circumstances.

587
00:50:56,062 --> 00:50:57,354
Really?

588
00:50:57,437 --> 00:51:00,104
-Stop that! Poor Mr. Muranishi!
