592
00:51:05,687 --> 00:51:07,979
-Muranishi!
-Stop right there, Muranishi!

593
00:51:12,229 --> 00:51:13,396
Cuff him!

594
00:51:14,396 --> 00:51:15,979
Muranishi!

595
00:51:21,062 --> 00:51:24,021
If you want to die, just look at me!
I sunk lower, but I'm alive!

